.claude/
.agents/

# Private competition seed data (real athlete PII, source CSV, photos) — never
# commit. Only `prod/` is private; other resources/seed/* datasets are shareable.
resources/seed/prod/

# Living project-management docs (backlog, per-item specs, parked owner tasks).
